  "content": {
    "equation": "Score = Rectal_Temp + MAP + HR + RR + Aa_Gradient_or_PO2 + pH_or_HCO3 + Na + K + Creat + Hct + WBC + Glasgow + Age + Chronic_Dx\nLog_OR = -3.517 + (Score * 0.146) + Post_Emerg_Surg + Admit_Dx\nOdds_Ratio = e(Log_OR)\nMortality = 100 * Odds_Ratio / ( 1 + Odds_Ratio )",
    "notes": [
      "For postoperative patients admitted to the ICU for sepsis or postarrest, use the corresponding weights for nonoperative patients.",
      "Chronic Health Problems: 1) Biopsy-proved liver cirrhosis 2) New York Heart Association Class IV 3)",
      "Severe COPD (eg. Hypercapnia, home O2, pulmonary Hypertension) 4) Chronic dialysis or 5)",
      "Immunocompromised."
    ],
    "conditional_notes": null,
    "calc_details": null,
    "data_input_disclaimer": "ONLY DIGITS 0 TO 9 AND A SINGLE DECIMAL POINT (\".\") ARE ACCEPTABLE AS NUMERIC INPUTS. ATTEMPTED INPUT OF OTHER CHARACTERS INTO A NUMERIC FIELD MAY LEAD TO AN INCORRECT RESULT.",
    "references": [
      {
